<title>USA: BOXING-WHITAKER DEFEATS HURTADO BY KNOCKOUT.</title>
<headline>BOXING-WHITAKER DEFEATS HURTADO BY KNOCKOUT.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY, New Jersey 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Pernell Whitaker got off the canvas twice and knocked out Cuban-born U.S. resident Diobelis Hurtado in the 11th round to retain his World Boxing Council welterweight champion Friday.</p>
<p>Whitaker is now 40-1-1 while Hurtado is 20-1.</p>
